<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1kg_1_1_knowledge_graph_1a61eb4f748d5e7c77383b9c861ccfbfcc" kindref="member">KnowledgeGraph</ref><sp/>g;</highlight></codeline>
